                   Ideally, if deleted destination is the primary, it becomes
                   a fast retransmission trigger by the subsequent SET PRIMARY.
                   (by micchie)
                 */
                if (sctp_is_mobility_feature_on(stcb->sctp_ep,
                                                SCTP_MOBILITY_BASE) ||
